      <activity id="32c58f94-81e5-5c8b-a5f6-07e80081f52e" activityNameId="e5ffb922-5b0c-5bd6-a44e-5fd39dfbc609" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Industrial residue wood, plywood prod., indoor use, hardwood, u=20%, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Industrial residue wood, plywood prod., indoor use, hardwood, u=20%, at plant
Different types of plywood are available depending on the number and height of the layers (type not specified). The multi-output process "plywood, indoor use, production" delivers the two coproducts "plywood, indoor use, at plant" and "industrial residue wood, plywood prod., indoor use, hardwood, u=20%, at plant". Allocation is based on the over-all proceeds of the process.;
UUID: b126ad57-88fe-3b17-a76d-1bff32f306ed
Includes the inputs to the production processes, transports of those inputs and the process emissions as far as they are available.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Medium sized enterprise technology in Switzerland (1996)
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: The assumption that the technology is representative for central Europe is considered in the uncertainties.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b126ad57-88fe-3b17-a76d-1bff32f306ed.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
